{"resourceIdentifier":"2880","resourceName":"BINZHOU TOPIGS NORSVIN BREEDING SWINE CO., LTD. BINHAI SWINE FARM BIOGAS RECOVERY AND UTILIZATION PROJECT","description":"Binzhou Topigs Norsvin Breeding Swine Co., Ltd. Binhai Swine Farm Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project is located in Zhanhua District, Binzhou City, Shandong Province, P.R China. The project is owned and implemented by Binzhou Topigs Norsvin Breeding Swine Co., Ltd. Binhai Branch.\r\nThis project is to build an anaerobic animal manure treatment system to treat manure waste of breeding swine in the Binhai Breeding Swine Farm. The project uses the HDPE membrane enclosed anaerobic digesters to treat animal manure waste, and the biogas produced in this process will be recovered and utilized by the biogas heating system for heat supply during the heating period (October to April next year). During the non-heating period (May to September),the biogas will be burnt through the biogas flare system. The residual waste from the digesters will be handled aerobically to produce organic fertilizer at the project site.\r\nPrior to the implementation of the project, the animal manure waste was left to decay in anaerobic manure management system (uncovered open lagoon) at the Binhai Breeding Swine Farm and methane is emitted to the atmosphere directly without any methane recovery and destruction facility.\r\nThe project is expected to avoid GHG emission of methane through recovery and destruction of biogas. For conservativeness, the emission reduction from the biogas heating system is not considered. The project is expected to achieve an annual emission reduction of 11,795 tCO2e and a total emission reduction of 82,563 tCO2e during the first 7-year renewable crediting period.","location":{"latitude":37.878610,"longitude":118.181666},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-04-23","endExclusive":"2022-05-24","endInclusive":"2022-05-23"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2880"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shandong Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Binzhou Topigs Norsvin Breeding Swine Co., Ltd. Binhai Branch"},{"type":"string","value":"shandong, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2880"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"11795"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"28/12/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 05/08/2020 - 04/08/2027"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=60552&IDKEY=rlksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098383501208","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"Binhai Biogas Revoery and Utilization_PD.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-01-28T15:42:06.317Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=60551&IDKEY=3kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909383499829","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Binhai Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-01-28T15:31:36.8Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=81703&IDKEY=s097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87s112668437","documentType":"Project Descri